{"id":"wb-7-1002","name":"真如寺石塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"真如寺石塔","text":"真如寺石塔位于浙江省温州市乐清市磐石镇重石村。真如寺始建于唐文德元年（888年），元大德二年（1298年）重建。寺前原有七座石塔，现仅存四座，其中三座顶盖缺失，仅一座保存完好。塔平面呈六角形。\n1997年8月29日，列入第四批浙江省文物保护单位。2013年5月，列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9C%9F%E5%A6%82%E5%AF%BA%E7%9F%B3%E5%A1%94","revisionId":89305538,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89305538","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2fe69f27ddd47fdb6295e23e.jpg","title":"Pagodas_of_Zhenru_Temple,_2021-05-01_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pagodas_of_Zhenru_Temple,_2021-05-01_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/Pagodas_of_Zhenru_Temple%2C_2021-05-01_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​乐清真如寺石塔","width":320,"height":214}}